{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1549078-need-advices-on-porting-harrier-du-bois-disco-elysium-into-dtr","id":1549078,"title":"Need advices on porting Harrier Du Bois [Disco Elysium] into DtR","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Deviant: The Renegades"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-03-08T06:52:08-08:00","id":1549078,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Need advices on porting Harrier Du Bois [Disco Elysium] into DtR","content":"I played in Disco Elysium and must say Harry has some low-mystic, deviant vibe. Yet, I have no idea how to recreate him as deviant or build him variations. He may be a Cepalist, Pathological, Devoted; I am not sure if his connection to the Pale and anomalies can make him an Outsider, most likely no. And there are skills / voices ~ I thought about Amalgam / Symbiont forms, but Harry is neither. He has no temporal insight or skill bust.<br /> <br /> I gave him omni-competence 1, clairvoyance (can't choose magnitude); I am not sure about Specialized Sense / Shadows of the Past &amp; Precognition. SS &amp; SP ~ I doubt his capability to perceive past or anomalies, yet he is somewhat attuned to mystical. Precognition 2 fits enough to work as visions generator whenever ST need it.<br /> <br /> Edit: Well... It seems that Tequila Sunset is Coactive, with Glitch 1 (because why not?), Hallucination 2, Precognition 2, Omnicompetence 1. New problem is scar choice in the future, will it be cyclic scar [glitch] bound to Omnicompetence, or something else. Also, it is hard to choose where to put free variation, and how will it work with CS / deviations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25408,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","user":"Alphari","date":".  Edit 03-11-2025, 05:35 PM"},"attachments"